CMD="wizard"
MARKER="❯ "
VERSION_CMD="wizard --version"
BUNDLE='stat -c %s /usr/local/bin/wizard'
NOTE="Default install.sh: the binary plus the loadout (~/.wizard/mcp.toml with a Playwright MCP run through npx, and four subagent files). The base image has no Node, so at every start that npx spawn fails at once and the first frame carries an MCP error banner; no Node process is in the tree and no npm lookup happens. On a machine with Node the same start forks npx and resolves @playwright/mcp against the registry, which is not measured here. Startup release check off via [update] notify = false."
